  "title": "Soft Mahi Mahi Tacos with Ginger-Lime Dressing",
  "description": "A warm, flavorful dish filled with mahi-mahi, fresh fruit and ginger-lime dressing. Unique, yet tasteful, this recipe is inspired by the fresh seafood recipes in Mexico and Central America.",
